[statement]
A candidate depending on a package beside the chain of requirements that
brought its name does not have a candidate whose dependency nothing can
answer passed over: `top` needs `z` and `b`, `b` needs `a`, and `a` 1
needs `z`; apk chooses `a` 3, which needs `missing`, and refuses
(`a-candidate-whose-dependency-cannot-be-met-is-passed-over-beside-one-depending-further-up`).

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:z b

P:z
V:1

P:a
V:1
D:z

P:a
V:3
D:missing

P:b
V:2
D:a

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   missing (no such package):
|     required by: a-3[missing]
